01:11:17.780 --> 01:11:21.090
Kematianmu tak berharga.

01:11:22.990 --> 01:11:26.090
Ah, gadis bisa jadi kejam!

01:11:26.120 --> 01:11:27.630
Jangan cemas, sayang!

01:11:27.660 --> 01:11:29.860
Kau masih bagus buatku.

01:11:49.250 --> 01:11:50.920
Ingin kulakukan perlahan?

01:11:58.760 --> 01:12:00.330
Kau di bawahku.

01:12:02.830 --> 01:12:05.000
Sekarang, hancurkan dia, sayangku.

01:12:58.950 --> 01:13:00.720
Kemenangan sempurna.

01:13:16.970 --> 01:13:19.300
- Ayah!
- Tidak!

01:13:19.340 --> 01:13:23.680
Kini kurobek tulang punggungmu, jawara!

01:13:23.710 --> 01:13:24.780
Persetan.

01:13:34.980 --> 01:13:36.290
Ibu!

01:13:42.260 --> 01:13:43.330
Masuk ke mobil.

01:13:43.360 --> 01:13:44.760
Masuk ke mobil!

01:13:49.330 --> 01:13:51.840
Ayo! Ayo! Ayo!

01:13:55.170 --> 01:13:56.210
Tidak, tidak.

01:13:59.380 --> 01:14:00.780
Ibu!

01:14:02.380 --> 01:14:03.450
Mendekatlah!

01:14:06.220 --> 01:14:07.820
Tidak, ibu!

01:14:13.160 --> 01:14:14.190
Aah!

01:14:16.760 --> 01:14:18.030
Cole!

01:14:18.060 --> 01:14:18.960
Allison!

01:14:33.280 --> 01:14:34.310
Aah!

01:14:40.450 --> 01:14:42.250
Menyingkir dariku!

01:15:07.940 --> 01:15:09.510
Ayah, gunakan pukulan pendek!

01:16:30.190 --> 01:16:31.600
Kalian baik-baik saja?

01:16:31.630 --> 01:16:33.500
Kami baik-baik saja.
Kalau kau?

01:16:33.530 --> 01:16:34.530
Ya.

01:16:35.570 --> 01:16:37.000
Kostumnya keren, ayah.

01:16:46.040 --> 01:16:47.050
Blade!

01:16:53.280 --> 01:16:55.150
Tolong!

01:17:55.550 --> 01:17:58.520
- Apa itu?
- Tak apa.

01:17:58.550 --> 01:17:59.980
Itu pintu kembali.

01:18:01.280 --> 01:18:02.390
Masih belum usai.

01:18:09.330 --> 01:18:11.230
Mustahil.

01:18:11.260 --> 01:18:14.300
Terima kasih telah membantu
petarungku menemukan arcana.

01:18:16.230 --> 01:18:19.940
Setelah 4000 tahun,
keturunan Hasashi masih hidup.

01:18:21.240 --> 01:18:22.210
Bi-Han.

01:18:29.610 --> 01:18:31.150
Hentikan dia!

01:18:41.560 --> 01:18:43.690
Jiwamu milikku.

01:18:47.100 --> 01:18:49.100
Jiwanya akan dihisap.

01:18:49.130 --> 01:18:51.340
Aku suka teriakan tepat sebelum ....

01:18:56.170 --> 01:18:57.270
Kena.

